WEBVTT

00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:13.446
So, you'll be landing there tomorrow.

00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:14.881
Yeah.

00:00:14.881 --> 00:00:16.883
Are you regretting it?

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:20.653
No, but...

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:24.391
You were selected to be
part of the initial landing party.

00:00:24.391 --> 00:00:26.726
It's a great honor!

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:30.497
You'll be taking a new step
in making history for mankind.

00:00:30.497 --> 00:00:31.598
Have confidence.

00:00:31.598 --> 00:00:32.999
But I...

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:37.370
You have work to do there,
and I have work to do here.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:39.305
It's as simple as that.

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:40.106
I...

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:44.873
Don't worry. I'll be
going down there in time, too.

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:48.510
You're going to wait for me, right?

00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:51.651
I'll wait patiently.

00:00:51.651 --> 00:00:53.620
You'd better.

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:56.923
But if I can't bear the wait any longer,

00:00:56.923 --> 00:00:59.448
I will come to get you.

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:03.963
Illumina...

00:01:03.963 --> 00:01:06.898
I will fulfill my promise to you now.

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:16.476
You know the continuation of
the fairy tale I've wanted to hear about?

00:01:16.476 --> 00:01:23.143
If it's eternal happiness,
I'll forge it with my own hand

00:01:24.651 --> 00:01:34.627
It's like we were both seeking
a coincidence that was off by a page

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:36.796
And that's how fate brought us together

00:01:36.796 --> 00:01:44.938
More than those words
that you once kept to yourself

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:53.880
It's the kindness
that made you keep them to yourself

00:01:53.880 --> 00:02:00.787
That I want to have faith in now

00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:08.528
You know, we'll be living
alongside uncertainty from now on

00:02:08.528 --> 00:02:14.934
We used to have nothing to lose,
but that's not us now

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:22.642
You know the continuation of
the fairy tale I didn't know about before?

00:02:22.642 --> 00:02:28.948
If it's eternal happiness,
I'll forge it with my own hand

00:02:28.948 --> 00:02:32.907
It's something to build up bit by bit

00:02:48.734 --> 00:02:52.604
Miss Accela... Thank goodness.

00:02:52.604 --> 00:02:57.075
I couldn't use the radio,
but the phone was still barely working.

00:02:57.075 --> 00:02:59.344
They said a rescue team
will be here right away.

00:02:59.344 --> 00:03:03.315
I see. Thank you very much.

00:03:03.315 --> 00:03:06.551
Solty?! Were you?

00:03:06.551 --> 00:03:08.220
I'm sorry.

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:10.422
It is not your fault, Miss Rose.

00:03:10.422 --> 00:03:12.913
Besides, this is no big deal.

00:03:14.392 --> 00:03:16.795
Solty...

00:03:16.795 --> 00:03:19.798
Please look after Miss Accela.

00:03:19.798 --> 00:03:21.566
Wait, where are you going?!

00:03:21.566 --> 00:03:23.869
If we stay here,
a rescue team will come...

00:03:23.869 --> 00:03:26.872
I must go.

00:03:26.872 --> 00:03:28.573
I have to stop him

00:03:28.573 --> 00:03:31.276
and keep my promise.

00:03:31.276 --> 00:03:33.044
Promise?

00:03:33.044 --> 00:03:34.568
I will be going now.

00:03:37.048 --> 00:03:39.551
Sheesh, there's no stopping you, is there?

00:03:39.551 --> 00:03:40.685
Miss Rose?

00:03:40.685 --> 00:03:42.854
I'll keep you company.

00:03:42.854 --> 00:03:45.322
This is you and me we're talking about.

00:03:47.826 --> 00:03:49.795
You're heavier than you look.

00:03:49.795 --> 00:03:51.695
What? Am I?

00:03:53.365 --> 00:03:55.901
Where are you planning on taking me?

00:03:55.901 --> 00:03:58.403
To Eunomia.

00:03:58.403 --> 00:04:00.972
In appreciation for stopping Eunomia,

00:04:00.972 --> 00:04:03.542
I'm inviting you to a show.

00:04:03.542 --> 00:04:05.243
A show?

00:04:05.243 --> 00:04:07.813
Of the moment this world changes.

00:04:07.813 --> 00:04:11.183
After all that's happened,
you're still plotting something more?

00:04:11.183 --> 00:04:15.453
Everything can still be fixed.
It's no problem.

00:04:15.453 --> 00:04:16.955
Damn!

00:04:16.955 --> 00:04:21.892
I have long wished
to return to those skies.

00:04:23.461 --> 00:04:27.265
After setting foot here as
part of the first landing party,

00:04:27.265 --> 00:04:29.835
I worked to build the underground city

00:04:29.835 --> 00:04:33.572
to accommodate my colleagues
who would be coming soon.

00:04:33.572 --> 00:04:39.909
But one day, the steady stream
of arrivals came to a sudden halt.

00:04:41.246 --> 00:04:43.415
What is going on here?!

00:04:43.415 --> 00:04:47.586
Not even a third of the people
on the ship have landed!

00:04:47.586 --> 00:04:49.688
I don't know, either.

00:04:49.688 --> 00:04:52.054
We've lost contact
with our people up there, too.

00:04:54.226 --> 00:04:56.194
What is Eunomia's response?

00:04:56.194 --> 00:04:58.763
It said, "Indeterminable."

00:04:58.763 --> 00:05:02.200
Its orders are to
continue our current work.

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:05.636
No, not that one!
The pipe one more to the right.

00:05:07.739 --> 00:05:08.740
Illumina...

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:10.139
Look out!

00:05:13.578 --> 00:05:18.650
This accident left me drifting
between life and death.

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:22.621
What saved me was Eunomia,
the nexus of our colonization plans

00:05:22.621 --> 00:05:27.559
and the city's supreme
decision-making computer.

00:05:27.559 --> 00:05:31.529
I became this world's first resemble.

00:05:31.529 --> 00:05:36.635
Original resemble parts were
integrated into me to prolong my life.

00:05:36.635 --> 00:05:43.975
Since then, I have not aged,
and have run the RUC as Eunomia's puppet,

00:05:43.975 --> 00:05:48.013
changing my position
and using aliases along the way.

00:05:48.013 --> 00:05:54.886
You're not going to tell me you
also created the RUC now, are you?

00:05:54.886 --> 00:05:56.688
Yes, I did.

00:05:56.688 --> 00:06:02.727
I am one of the RUC's founders
and its last overseer.

00:06:02.727 --> 00:06:06.898
But even as an overseer, I couldn't
tell what was happening above.

00:06:06.898 --> 00:06:10.969
No matter how long I waited,
no more of my colleagues came down.

00:06:10.969 --> 00:06:15.565
So instead, I made plans to head skyward.

00:06:19.477 --> 00:06:22.674
But that ended in failure.

00:06:24.049 --> 00:06:28.320
It became the first casualty of
the Aurora Shell's lightning bolts.

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:31.189
I refused to give up, however.

00:06:31.189 --> 00:06:35.660
Then, twelve years ago, I finally
got the chance I had hoped for.

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:38.663
Twelve years ago?

00:06:38.663 --> 00:06:43.635
I removed my original resemble parts
in order to leave Eunomia's control

00:06:43.635 --> 00:06:46.071
and attempted to fly skyward

00:06:46.071 --> 00:06:49.939
in a machine built to withstand
the bolts of lightning, of course.

00:06:52.143 --> 00:06:53.542
However...

00:07:03.455 --> 00:07:06.624
The lightning bolt destroyed
the old RUC building,

00:07:06.624 --> 00:07:08.226
which was the launch pad.

00:07:08.226 --> 00:07:13.687
I myself suffered severe injuries
inside the crushed machine.

00:07:15.433 --> 00:07:21.940
Ironically, Eunomia, whom I so despised,
saved my life once again.

00:07:21.940 --> 00:07:27.479
Though, it resulted in most
of my body being resemblized.

00:07:27.479 --> 00:07:31.210
That means Blast Fall
happened because of you!

00:07:34.119 --> 00:07:35.453
You bastard!

00:07:35.453 --> 00:07:39.090
I will rectify the erroneous choices
I made in the past.

00:07:39.090 --> 00:07:41.292
We're here.

00:07:41.292 --> 00:07:43.726
This is the stage of the show.

00:07:49.067 --> 00:07:50.668
This is...

00:07:50.668 --> 00:07:52.499
...that place he showed me...

00:07:53.471 --> 00:07:56.107
Eunomia is down there.

00:07:56.107 --> 00:07:57.709
I had no idea.

00:07:57.709 --> 00:07:59.444
It will get dangerous from here on out,

00:07:59.444 --> 00:08:01.946
so please find somewhere safe, Miss Rose.

00:08:01.946 --> 00:08:03.882
- What?
- Thank you very much.

00:08:03.882 --> 00:08:05.517
- Wait!
- What?

00:08:05.517 --> 00:08:07.109
- Uh-oh...
- Miss Rose?

00:08:10.789 --> 00:08:15.093
Thanks to you,
Eunomia has stopped functioning.

00:08:15.093 --> 00:08:19.230
Right now, even I could
probably take over Eunomia...

00:08:19.230 --> 00:08:21.299
...using this.

00:08:21.299 --> 00:08:25.670
You involved Rose and myself

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:31.142
and sacrificed many lives,
leaving many people unhappy.

00:08:31.142 --> 00:08:34.879
They were people under my management.

00:08:34.879 --> 00:08:38.110
I could care less what happens to them.

00:08:45.924 --> 00:08:49.394
You cannot stop me.

00:08:49.394 --> 00:08:52.564
A spectator should watch the show quietly.

00:08:52.564 --> 00:08:54.065
Damn it!

00:08:54.065 --> 00:08:56.829
It seems there's no talking to you.

00:09:06.811 --> 00:09:09.914
Good grief. That was some entrance.

00:09:09.914 --> 00:09:14.519
Why are you here, Rose? And you, Dike?

00:09:14.519 --> 00:09:17.489
I thought I had destroyed you.

00:09:17.489 --> 00:09:21.926
Sorry, the RUC wasn't for me, after all.

00:09:21.926 --> 00:09:25.630
Mr. Joseph repaired me.

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:27.732
So that's what happened.

00:09:27.732 --> 00:09:30.168
Why did you come here?

00:09:30.168 --> 00:09:33.071
What a greeting for someone
you haven't seen in a long time, Dad.

00:09:33.071 --> 00:09:34.504
Dad?!

00:09:36.541 --> 00:09:37.675
- Solty!
- Hey...

00:09:37.675 --> 00:09:39.677
I am all right.

00:09:39.677 --> 00:09:42.847
I have come to help, Dad.

00:09:42.847 --> 00:09:44.314
You two...

00:09:45.483 --> 00:09:47.619
Stop with the "Dad."

00:09:47.619 --> 00:09:48.520
He's blushing.

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:50.155
He is bright red.

00:09:50.155 --> 00:09:53.191
Can we stop the comedy there?

00:09:53.191 --> 00:09:57.355
You weren't in my cast list,
but shall we begin the show?

00:10:08.606 --> 00:10:10.441
Roy Revant...

00:10:10.441 --> 00:10:13.478
I'll give you a role, as well.

00:10:13.478 --> 00:10:15.780
Kill one of the two.

00:10:15.780 --> 00:10:17.115
What?!

00:10:17.115 --> 00:10:22.453
Do it, and I'll let you
and the one who's left, go.

00:10:22.453 --> 00:10:24.889
Now choose!

00:10:24.889 --> 00:10:28.950
Let's see your choice! It will
add a colorful touch to the show!

00:10:36.067 --> 00:10:38.803
Come, make your choice quickly!

00:10:38.803 --> 00:10:40.638
Stop this!

00:10:40.638 --> 00:10:43.074
Have you made up your mind?

00:10:43.074 --> 00:10:44.632
Yeah.

00:10:52.383 --> 00:10:53.518
Mr. Roy...

00:10:53.518 --> 00:10:56.248
Hey, old man, what're you thinking?!

00:10:58.823 --> 00:11:01.223
Your choice is erroneous.

00:11:03.461 --> 00:11:05.597
What the?!

00:11:05.597 --> 00:11:08.031
Get it right this time.

00:11:11.703 --> 00:11:16.040
Now, pull the trigger whenever you like.

00:11:16.040 --> 00:11:20.306
Better hurry, or both their bodies
will be torn apart.

00:11:21.913 --> 00:11:23.778
Now, choose!

00:11:26.818 --> 00:11:28.911
Time's running out.

00:11:41.065 --> 00:11:42.433
What?!

00:11:42.433 --> 00:11:43.991
Mr. Roy...

00:11:48.339 --> 00:11:52.043
Sorry. This is my choice.

00:11:52.043 --> 00:11:57.548
Shooting my daughters
isn't an answer in my book!

00:11:57.548 --> 00:11:58.816
I see.

00:11:58.816 --> 00:12:00.647
Then you die.

00:12:03.921 --> 00:12:05.320
Old man!

00:12:08.493 --> 00:12:10.427
Foolish man.

00:12:17.402 --> 00:12:18.892
Mr. Roy...

00:12:27.879 --> 00:12:29.210
What's going on?

00:12:35.720 --> 00:12:37.955
What?!

00:12:37.955 --> 00:12:40.549
You intend to control me directly?!

00:12:50.768 --> 00:12:53.271
Please stop this now.

00:12:53.271 --> 00:12:55.603
It isn't over yet.

00:13:02.714 --> 00:13:04.011
Ashley!

00:13:12.957 --> 00:13:14.826
Dike...

00:13:14.826 --> 00:13:17.920
This time, I'll reduce you to scrap.

00:13:24.969 --> 00:13:26.266
Mr. Roy...

00:13:27.672 --> 00:13:30.808
Are you all right, Solty?

00:13:30.808 --> 00:13:32.799
No effect.

00:13:51.329 --> 00:13:55.600
Curse you, Eunomia...

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:58.136
If you're going to kill me, do it.

00:13:58.136 --> 00:13:59.771
Mr. Ashley...

00:13:59.771 --> 00:14:03.741
There is something I need to tell you.

00:14:03.741 --> 00:14:09.914
The people above have already
been wiped out, haven't they?

00:14:09.914 --> 00:14:12.049
How did you know that?

00:14:12.049 --> 00:14:14.018
Just as I thought...

00:14:14.018 --> 00:14:16.521
I had a vague feeling that was the case.

00:14:16.521 --> 00:14:19.791
But what meaning does that have now?

00:14:19.791 --> 00:14:23.628
All I ever wanted was to go back.

00:14:23.628 --> 00:14:26.397
To keep the promise I made to her.

00:14:26.397 --> 00:14:27.865
That's absurd!

00:14:27.865 --> 00:14:30.902
You were just like me, weren't you?

00:14:30.902 --> 00:14:32.570
Roy Revant.

00:14:32.570 --> 00:14:34.172
What?

00:14:34.172 --> 00:14:40.945
You sought your daughter.
I sought Illumina.

00:14:40.945 --> 00:14:47.051
We sought them continuously through
all the years they were lost to us.

00:14:47.051 --> 00:14:52.590
For you, it was twelve years.
For me, it was 200 years.

00:14:52.590 --> 00:14:54.759
You've forgotten...

00:14:54.759 --> 00:14:58.596
The feelings of despair, loneliness,
and the unbearable sorrow

00:14:58.596 --> 00:15:03.301
of the moment when you lose a loved one.

00:15:03.301 --> 00:15:09.640
You've forgotten the fretfulness
that would make you do anything at all

00:15:09.640 --> 00:15:12.777
to get your loved one back, haven't you?

00:15:12.777 --> 00:15:18.783
Yeah, you're right. I was once like you.

00:15:18.783 --> 00:15:22.053
But I'm different now.

00:15:22.053 --> 00:15:24.455
I've changed.

00:15:24.455 --> 00:15:27.358
These two are with me now.

00:15:27.358 --> 00:15:29.760
That's why I was able to change.

00:15:29.760 --> 00:15:32.063
You should have been able to change, too.

00:15:32.063 --> 00:15:35.533
You had Integra and the others beside you.

00:15:35.533 --> 00:15:38.302
They loved you.

00:15:38.302 --> 00:15:43.941
But you were the one who cast them away.

00:15:43.941 --> 00:15:45.670
That's an unfair argument.

00:15:49.180 --> 00:15:52.750
Mr. Ashley... Or rather, Mr. Locke...

00:15:52.750 --> 00:15:56.621
I have a message for you
from Miss Illumina.

00:15:56.621 --> 00:15:58.055
What?

00:15:58.055 --> 00:16:03.083
It is a message Miss Illumina
left for you just before she died.

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:07.322
Locke...

00:16:08.499 --> 00:16:10.735
Illumina...

00:16:10.735 --> 00:16:13.104
I love you, Locke.

00:16:13.104 --> 00:16:17.241
I'm sorry. It turns out I can't go down now,

00:16:17.241 --> 00:16:20.972
although I wanted to live
in the city you built.

00:16:22.780 --> 00:16:26.851
I loved your smile.

00:16:26.851 --> 00:16:30.947
That shy, gentle smile of yours.

00:16:32.123 --> 00:16:35.259
But I'll never see it again...

00:16:35.259 --> 00:16:39.030
That's why I want you to smile.

00:16:39.030 --> 00:16:42.233
No matter how difficult
or how sad it may be for you,

00:16:42.233 --> 00:16:45.069
I pray that you'll always be smiling.

00:16:45.069 --> 00:16:48.439
That's my one wish.

00:16:48.439 --> 00:16:50.464
Illumina...

00:17:07.291 --> 00:17:10.861
We meet at last, Eunomia.

00:17:10.861 --> 00:17:15.833
Though, it took me a long time to get here.

00:17:15.833 --> 00:17:18.369
You have also committed a mistake.

00:17:18.369 --> 00:17:20.633
Even if it was for the sake of humanity.

00:17:22.406 --> 00:17:28.913
Do not worry, for human beings
are very strong and kind.

00:17:28.913 --> 00:17:31.449
I believe in them.

00:17:31.449 --> 00:17:33.684
So...

00:17:33.684 --> 00:17:35.413
Good night.

00:17:43.628 --> 00:17:47.587
Goodbye, my alter ego.

00:17:53.304 --> 00:18:00.411
I only have one wish

00:18:00.411 --> 00:18:04.515
I just want to be here

00:18:04.515 --> 00:18:08.986
I just want to be here
